    {
      "location": "translation.html, paragraph 2",
      "severity": "minor",
      "source_quote": "Hoffs (house/barn fort enclosures) ... the exiled Swiss Brethren ... help rebuild the farms ... excellent husbandmen and tillers of the soil",
      "suggested_fix": "Gebruik “Hoffs (versterkte huis-en-skuurkomplekse)”, “die verbanne Switserse Broeders”, “om die plase te help herbou” en “uitstekende boere en grondbewerkers”, sonder om die paragraafstruktuur te verander.",
      "translation_quote": "Hoffs (huis/skuur-omheinings) ... die verbande Switserse Broeders ... help om die plase herbou ... uitstekende boere en grondbewerker"
    },
    {
      "location": "translation.html, paragraphs 3–4",
      "severity": "minor",
      "source_quote": "Catholic, Lutheran, and Reformed ... the introduction of the legume, clover",
      "suggested_fix": "Vervang “Luterus” met “Luthers” en “die invoering van peule, klawer” met “die invoering van klawer, ’n peulgewas”.",
      "translation_quote": "Katoliek, Luterus en Gereformeerd ... die invoering van peule, klawer"
    },
    {
      "location": "translation.html, paragraph 7, description of land",
      "severity": "major",
      "source_quote": "some very rich and well-watered lands",
      "suggested_fix": "Vervang “’n paar baie ryk en goed-geoogde lande” met “besonder vrugbare grond met volop water”.",
      "translation_quote": "’n paar baie ryk en goed-geoogde lande"
    },
    {
      "location": "translation.html, paragraph 7, predators",
      "severity": "major",
      "source_quote": "Wolves, bears, panthers, bobcats and other predators abounded.",
      "suggested_fix": "Vervang “luiperdkatte” met “poemas”, die bedoelde Amerikaanse panters in hierdie konteks. Behou die ander diere en die bestaande HTML.",
      "translation_quote": "Wolwe, bere, luiperdkatte, bobkatte en ander roofdiere was volop."
    },
    {
      "location": "translation.html, paragraph 7, land grant",
      "severity": "major",
      "source_quote": "They received a land patent for 10,000 acres for their families and others that might come later.",
